{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564100/extras/ab4816b44d31fec7fecb4e3e2ad1043c.avif?t=1772694942\" width=614 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Story</h2><br>My partners from the Institute of Vernacular Studies and I boarded a real estate train to visit the culture of a local village.<br>There was a train crash on the way.<br>Ma Yi-hao, the proud and egotistical son of a rich man\u3001Hsu Fang-yuan, the wounded but kindhearted\u3001Mo Wan-nan, who always makes fun of me\u3001Ho Siu Sze, the timid and sulky one....And the silent Cho Eun-ah.<br>The five of us were lost in the mountains and, exhausted and thirsty, we met a mysterious girl in red.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564100/extras/e044ff9b916ca3bb233e435bbc9b2961.avif?t=1772694942\" width=614 height=346 /></span><br><br>She invited us to her villa and entertained us.<br>I even took the initiative to take off my clothes and swallow my rod with my little mouth down there.<br>But the next day we woke up in a cave with our mouths full of weeds and dirt - we had met the mountain monster &quot;Moshina&quot;?<br>How do we get down the mountain? What is the purpose of the girl in red? Is it to drain us of our essence? Or...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2564100/extras/63a94ebda79be64dd114748010760c3f.avif?t=1772694942\" width=614 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Gameplay</h2><br>Exploration puzzle game with suspense and horror elements<br>Players take on the role of the protagonist and try to uncover the truth while escaping the control of the girl in red in order to survive.<br>Will the puzzles and resources scattered throughout the locations bring hope - or despair?<br><br><span class=